{"id":"3d723e7354af2d81","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Algebraic Domain","display":"df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain — ZFC Order9 Algebraic Domain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain — ZFC Order9 Algebraic Domain","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-algebraic-domain — ZFC Order9 Algebraic Domain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd92cc6b411eb77\" href=\"?note=3cd92cc6b411eb77\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S\\)</span> is directed completeness (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd92cc6b411eb77\" href=\"?note=3cd92cc6b411eb77\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the order-compact-element predicate defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9AlgebraicDomain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9AlgebraicDomain}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}compact\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(x\\leq_Pz\\land y\\leq_Pz)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Ps)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Pu)\\to s\\leq_Pu)\\land k\\leq_Ps\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Pd)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}compact\\text{-}element}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;k\\in P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;\\Bigl(D\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(x\\leq_Pz\\land y\\leq_Pz)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Ps)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Pu)\\to s\\leq_Pu)\\land k\\leq_Ps\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Pd)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9AlgebraicDomain}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists D\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(D\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\\land k\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall k_1,k_2\\in D\\;\\exists k_3\\in D\\;(k_1\\leq_Pk_3\\land k_2\\leq_Pk_3)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\forall k\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Pu)\\to x\\leq_Pu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}algebraic\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9AlgebraicDomain}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12DirectedCompletePoset}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;\\exists D\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(D\\neq\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in D\\;(\\mathrm{OrderCompact}_S(k,P,\\leq_P)\\land k\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall k_1,k_2\\in D\\;\\exists k_3\\in D\\;(k_1\\leq_Pk_3\\land k_2\\leq_Pk_3)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;(\\forall k\\in D\\;(k\\leq_Pu)\\to x\\leq_Pu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary domain-theoretic definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-order12-directed-complete-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd92cc6b411eb77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-order